  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FUTURE-READY SOCIAL PROTECTION &amp; RESILIENT CARE THROUGH TRANSFORMATIVE GOVERNANCE</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Partnership between UNDP and DFAT aims to advance transformative governance for social protection and integrated care in Malaysia. By leveraging inclusive, integrated, and future-ready systems, the collaboration seeks to enhance the well-being of all Malaysians&#x2014;especially vulnerable and informal groups&#x2014;through resilient social protection and care services anchored in accountable and digitally enabled governance.</narrative>
  </description>
